    "A driver started `claude --settings <file> --allowedTools \"Bash(sleep 60)\"` in a pseudo-terminal of 160 columns and 50 rows, in a new empty folder that is no git repository, with the person's own settings and plugins in place and no variable of an enclosing Claude Code or Orca session. Every `at` below counts milliseconds from that start.",
