    "At 0.00 s, the driver started the session.",
    "At 0.27 s, the driver learned the session log's path from a hook event.",
    "At 3.88 s, the driver sent the prompt that asks for `sleep 60`.",
    "At 123.94 s, the driver stopped the steps, because no PreToolUse of Bash had arrived in the 120 s it waits for one.",
    "At 124.54 s, the driver typed /exit.",
    "At 125.21 s, the session's process exited.",
